    dict(key='08-act-3', kind='console', title='Act Three — The middle, and comparison functions',
         body='THREE. The middle, and comparison functions.\n  insert_at(0, Intro (0:42)): 9 songs shifted right\n  delete_at(5) removed Paper Moon: 4 songs shifted left\n  linear_search(Echoes (3:21), compare_song) = index 6 after 7 comparisons: title and length compared\n  linear_search(Echoes (3:20)) = -1: a different length is a different song',
         narration='Now the middle. [[slnc 400]] Inserting an intro shifts nine songs. [[slnc 300]] Deleting at index five shifts four. [[slnc 500]] To search, the array needs a comparison function. [[slnc 400]] Ours compares the title, then the length. [[slnc 400]] Echoes, three minutes twenty one, is found at index six. [[slnc 300]] Echoes, three minutes twenty, is not: a different song.'),
