    dict(key='10-act-4', kind='console', title='Act Four — Deleting, and giving memory back',
         body='FOUR. Deleting, and giving memory back.\n  capacity 16, size 9: 7 places spare\n  delete_at_end() removed Last Train; its bytes were copied out to the caller\n  shrink_to_fit(): capacity 8, 8 songs copied',
         narration="Deleting copies the song out to you, because the array's own memory may be reused. [[slnc 400]] Then shrink to fit copies eight songs into a block of exactly eight places, and frees the big one."),
